<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>Note:&#x000D;&#x000A;For the instruments connection, it&apos;s also possible to insert an M9536A AXIe embedded controller in the same M9505 AXIe chassis and run SystemVue on the embedded controller, instead of connecting M9505 AXIe chassis with PC via a PCI Express cable as shown in above diagram.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;If above picture can&apos;t be loaded in this schematic, please find and view &quot;multi-channel_cali_connection.png&quot; in the same directory as this example workspace.</DataEntry>
